This repository contains files derived from third-party data:
data/processed/panel.parquet, artifacts/predictions.parquet and artifacts/model.joblib
are built from the datasets below, which were aggregated to a 0.25-degree grid and
transformed into annual features. Raw data is not redistributed; `make data` downloads it.

- Hansen/UMD/Google/USGS/NASA Global Forest Change 2000-2024 (v1.12).
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
  Hansen, M. C. et al. (2013). High-Resolution Global Maps of 21st-Century Forest
  Cover Change. Science 342, 850-853. https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1244693
- NOAA Climate Data Record (CDR) of AVHRR and VIIRS Normalized Difference Vegetation
  Index, NOAA National Centers for Environmental Information. NOAA open data.
- PERSIANN-CDR precipitation, NOAA National Centers for Environmental Information.
  Ashouri, H. et al. (2015). PERSIANN-CDR: Daily Precipitation Climate Data Record from
  Multisatellite Observations for Hydrological and Climate Studies. Bull. Amer. Meteor.
  Soc. 96, 69-83. https://doi.org/10.1175/BAMS-D-13-00068.1
